  migraine in adults.", "background": "This is an updated version of the original Cochrane review published in Issue    
  11, 2010 (Derry 2010). Migraine is a common, disabling condition and a burden for the individual, health services     
  and society. Many sufferers choose not to, or are unable to, seek professional help and rely on over‐the‐counter      
